WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:41.010
<i>While the fierce battle
against Devimon continued...</i>

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:45.410
<i>Koshiro discovered that energy produced
from confusion within the network</i>

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:48.920
<i>was being transferred to Devimon.</i>

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:56.960
<i>Upon hearing that, Atlurkabuterimon's
group headed to the energy transfer point</i>

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:59.320
<i>and succeeded in intercepting it.</i>

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:04.540
<i>The children defeated
the evolved Neodevimon at last.</i>

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:06.460
<i>However...</i>

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:17.950
THE FINAL STAGE, DONEDEVIMON

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:35.860
This isn't good! Get back!

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:04.850
A Mega Digimon.

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:07.410
A Mega Digimon?

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:12.400
So this is the evolution
Devimon was aiming for?

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:17.420
But now, Devimon isn't Devimon anymore.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.920
DONEDEVIMON

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:21.670
Tokomon?

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:23.950
Only Devimon's powers evolved.

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:28.160
The mind is already...

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.380
Yamato!

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:00.610
If worst comes to worst, run!

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.950
Don't mind us!

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:08.600
Weregarurumon!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.080
Metalgreymon!

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:14.650
Yamato!

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:26.070
Kaiser Nail!

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:49.840
Miasma!

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:52.810
If these arms touch us,
we won't stand a chance!

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:13.600
What?!

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:22.960
Giga Storm!

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.450
That idiot!

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:40.840
Taichi!

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:43.230
Yamato!

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:01.210
Yamato! Taichi-san!

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:14.370
<i>Koshiro-san, do you hear me?!
This side's a disaster!</i>

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:16.450
<i>Shadow Wing!</i>

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:21.310
<i>There's still a ton of them left!</i>

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:23.590
<i>Flower Cannon!</i>

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:28.490
Lilimon, are you okay?!

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:31.790
<i>I'm okay... but struggling a little.</i>

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.370
<i>This is endless!</i>

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:37.160
<i>Koshiro-san, is there anything odd
happening on your side?</i>

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.060
W-Wait one moment...

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:43.380
Oh no!

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:47.990
Just a few minutes ago, two tankers
have collided in the Strait of Hormuz!

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:50.800
Not only that!

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:55.910
Abnormally close encounters between large
vessels are rapidly occurring everywhere!

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:03.480
Simultaneous accidents
in oceans all over the world?!

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:04.850
Oh no...

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:06.880
What on earth is going on?

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:12.550
It means that we haven't
escaped danger yet!

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:18.060
We're surrounded!

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:21.120
What an annoying lot.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:23.620
We must work together and break through!

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:24.650
Yes!

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:52.180
Yamato!

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:05.020
You're not getting away!

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:33.700
Kaiser...

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:36.720
Nail!

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:56.800
Yamato!

00:08:57.410 --> 00:08:58.260
Yamato!

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:19.030
Yamato!

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:21.720
Yamato!

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:23.850
Yamato!

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:26.230
Takeru!

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:33.880
Takeru...

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:35.610
Takeru, come back!

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:37.950
Takeru!

00:09:55.970 --> 00:09:57.320
Takeru!

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:30.520
Tokomon?!

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:42.470
Takeru!

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:54.040
S... Stop!

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:07.540
Stop...

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:30.940
Stop!

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:45.850
Tokomon!

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:00.510
Yamato!

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:02.110
Yamato!

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:03.720
Yamato...

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:05.870
Gabumon...

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:55.690
Taichi-san!

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:13.370
No...

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:14.910
You can't...

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:57.080
Metalgreymon's furious...

00:14:57.080 --> 00:15:01.560
So furious that
Metalgreymon's mind is going blank.

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:07.130
No... At this rate, Metalgreymon
will become just like Devimon.

00:15:22.170 --> 00:15:23.250
Yamato...

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:26.650
Yamato!

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:29.420
Takeru...

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:31.410
Yamato...

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:35.030
That's...

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:38.220
That's... Metalgreymon?

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:21.720
Takeru, help me!

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:22.730
What?

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:25.160
With our powers, we can surely...

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:30.900
Right!

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:40.410
What's this?

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:23.560
You mustn't let anger consume your mind.

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:31.060
Calm your heart and feel...

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:42.870
Feel that presence irreplaceable to you.

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:53.670
<i>Who is it?</i>

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:56.960
<i>Who's calling me?</i>

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:03.640
<i>The one...</i>

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:06.580
<i>The one calling me is...</i>

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:14.770
<i>Taichi!</i>

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:34.500
That light...

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:40.590
Taichi-san...

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:41.940
Agumon...

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:44.700
Tokomon?!

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:53.140
Tokomon Evolution!

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:03.260
Patamon!

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:04.150
PATAMON

00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:07.660
Patamon?!

00:21:13.350 --> 00:21:15.440
Taichi-san!

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:18.440
Agumon!

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:45.470
<i>Why do these held hands</i>

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:45.470
<i>naze ima kono te to te nigitte</i>

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:48.140
<i>And the warmth exchanged</i>

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:48.140
<i>tashikameta taion wo</i>

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:50.600
<i>Make me reminisce now</i>

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:50.600
<i>natsukashiku omou noka</i>

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:56.190
<i>Why an abyss dancing with endless rain</i>

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:56.190
<i>naze samidare no susabu shinen</i>

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:58.690
<i>The gaze of that smile</i>

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:58.690
<i>hohoenda sono shisen ni</i>

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:00.060
<i>Makes me want to cry</i>

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:00.060
<i>nakitaku naru</i>

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:02.980
<i>So call me with that voice</i>

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:02.980
<i>sono koe de boku wo yonde kure</i>

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:05.150
<i>This weakness I cannot tell others</i>

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:05.150
<i>dare ni ienu kono yowasa ga</i>

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.240
<i>I realize is my pillar to stand firm</i>

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.240
<i>tsuyoku tatsu tame no jiku dato omoishiru</i>

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:10.530
<i>Difference is what makes me adore you</i>

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:10.530
<i>chigau kara itooshiku naru</i>

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:13.490
<i>I just want to understand you and me</i>

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:13.490
<i>tada wakaritai kimi to boku wo</i>

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:15.700
<i>Scars grow the more we live</i>

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:15.700
<i>ikiru hodo kizu ga fuete iku</i>

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:18.960
<i>But still we seek the reasons for us</i>

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:18.960
<i>sore demo sagashiteiru bokura no wake wo</i>

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>Overlaying them makes us beautiful</i>

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>kasanete wa utsukushiku naru</i>

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:25.130
<i>I want to know now, I want to cry out</i>

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:25.130
<i>ima wakaritai sakebi dashitai</i>

00:22:31.350 --> 00:22:32.930
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:35.330
<i>Garudamon.</i>

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:37.950
<i>This Digimon super evolves from Birdramon.</i>

00:22:35.430 --> 00:22:37.890
LEVEL: ULTIMATE

00:22:37.950 --> 00:22:41.330
<i>Garudamon flies through the sky
and attacks enemies with fire.</i>

00:22:38.060 --> 00:22:40.520
TYPE: BIRD-MAN

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:43.190
SPECIAL MOVE: SHADOW WING

00:22:41.330 --> 00:22:43.190
<i>Garudamon's specialty is Shadow Wing!</i>

00:22:43.820 --> 00:22:45.750
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:50.140
<i>I wonder if Garudamon's long hair
ever gets in the way of battle?</i>

00:22:50.140 --> 00:22:54.950
<i>Tentomon was saying,
"I want long hair too" though.</i>

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:59.870
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:04.270
<i>Swarms of Mamemon appear!</i>

00:23:04.270 --> 00:23:07.900
<i>Taichi and the others risk their lives
with an extraordinary plan!</i>

00:23:07.900 --> 00:23:12.240
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"Dive to the Next Ocean"</i>

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:14.600
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
